{"name":"The Deadreg Glass","slug":"glyph-deadreg-glass","blurb":"On the census street, Sable carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Deadreg. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Deadreg Glass.","seal":"9c0185d8e8176593cd7e298349155a6c970121d365b4a7cdde55ba43f0f5b670"}
